      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْحَجٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْتَحَجٌ</span></b>  (As, S, K) <i>A place
